            /// containing a <c>NODE_</c> prefix in the <c>cmd</c> property are reserved for use within
            /// Node.js core and will not be emitted in the child's <c>'message'</c> event. Rather, such messages are emitted using the <c>'internalMessage'</c> event and are consumed internally by Node.js.
            /// Applications should avoid using such messages or listening for <c>'internalMessage'</c> events as it is subject to change without notice.
            ///
